{"seq":1,"slug":"context-selection","title":"上下文选择","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-context-engineering/assembly/context-selection","wordCount":1295,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"上下文选择\">上下文选择</h1><p>装配一份窗口的第一道工序，是从远超容量的候选里挑出该进去的那一小撮。挑错方向有两种：选得太省，模型缺关键事实、瞎编或绕路；选得太滥，关键信息被噪声稀释、触发分心。2026 年的一个反直觉结论是，后者往往比前者更致命——因为模型不会告诉你它被淹没了。本篇讲选择的对象、判据与机制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>选择是一个带预算约束的相关性排序问题：给定候选集合（历史、检索片段、记忆条目、工具定义），在不超过 token 预算的前提下，挑出对当前决策边际效用最高的子集。它的反面不是「选更多」，而是「选更准」——多选一段无关内容的代价，是它分走了模型对关键内容的注意力。</p>\n<p>下图把选择拆成一条从候选到入窗的漏斗，每一级都在做「保留还是丢弃」的判定。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  C[全部候选&lt;br/&gt;历史/检索/记忆/工具] --&gt; R[相关性打分&lt;br/&gt;检索分/时效/重要度]&#10;  R --&gt; T[阈值过滤&lt;br/&gt;低分丢弃]&#10;  T --&gt; D[去重与互补&lt;br/&gt;避免冗余片段]&#10;  D --&gt; B[预算裁剪&lt;br/&gt;按额度截断]&#10;  B --&gt; O[入窗子集]&#10;  C -.工具子集.-&gt; TS[工具选择&lt;br/&gt;按任务收敛能力]&#10;  TS --&gt; O\">flowchart TD\n  C[全部候选&lt;br/&gt;历史/检索/记忆/工具] --&gt; R[相关性打分&lt;br/&gt;检索分/时效/重要度]\n  R --&gt; T[阈值过滤&lt;br/&gt;低分丢弃]\n  T --&gt; D[去重与互补&lt;br/&gt;避免冗余片段]\n  D --&gt; B[预算裁剪&lt;br/&gt;按额度截断]\n  B --&gt; O[入窗子集]\n  C -.工具子集.-&gt; TS[工具选择&lt;br/&gt;按任务收敛能力]\n  TS --&gt; O</pre><p>选择的对象不止「文本片段」，下表列出四类候选各自的选择判据。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>候选类型</th>\n<th>主要判据</th>\n<th>典型机制</th>\n<th>选过头的症状</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>历史消息</td>\n<td>时效 + 与当前子任务相关</td>\n<td>滑动窗口 / 摘要替换</td>\n<td>陈旧寒暄挤占额度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>检索片段</td>\n<td>语义相似度 + 重排分</td>\n<td>RAG + reranker</td>\n<td>近义重复、噪声片段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>记忆条目</td>\n<td>重要度 + 时近性 + 相关性</td>\n<td>评分检索</td>\n<td>不相关旧偏好误导</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工具定义</td>\n<td>当前任务是否可能用到</td>\n<td>工具路由 / 分组</td>\n<td>上百工具喧宾夺主</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>检索片段的相似度与重排细节属于 RAG，见 <a href=\"../../rag-knowledge-systems/retrieval-pipeline/retrieval-ranking\">检索排序</a>；记忆条目的检索相关性见 <a href=\"../../ai-agent-memory-systems/operations/retrieval-relevance\">记忆检索相关性</a>。本篇聚焦「选进窗口」这一层的决策，不重复其内部算法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"相关性判据-不只是语义相似\">相关性判据：不只是语义相似</h2><p>新手容易把选择等同于「语义相似度最高的 top-k」，但生产里相关性是多信号的加权。一个常用的合成分把三个维度线性组合：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>score</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>sim</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>recency</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>importance</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{score}(c) = \\alpha \\cdot \\text{sim}(c, q) + \\beta \\cdot \\text{recency}(c) + \\gamma \\cdot \\text{importance}(c)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">score</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sim</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">recency</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">importance</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>sim</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{sim}(c,q)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sim</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是候选 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 与当前查询 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 的语义相似度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>recency</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{recency}(c)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">recency</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是时近性，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>importance</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{importance}(c)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">importance</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是预先标注或学到的重要度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>β</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span> 按场景调。对客服记忆，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span> 高（用户的关键偏好不该因为旧而被丢）；对实时协作，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 高（最近的状态更重要）。把相关性当单信号，是选择策略最常见的退化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"top-k-不是越大越好\">top-k 不是越大越好</h2><p>直觉上 top-k 越大召回越全，但选择有个明显的拐点。多段近义片段不会线性增加信息，反而增加冗余与噪声；而每多一段都在抬高窗口占用率，逼近 <a href=\"../foundations/context-window-budget\">上下文窗口预算</a> 里讲的质量税阈值。实践经验是：先用较大的 k 召回，再用去重和重排压到一个小得多的入窗集合，通常 3–5 段高质量片段优于 15 段平庸片段。这条「召回宽、入窗窄」的原则，和 RAG 里的重排策略同源，见 <a href=\"../../rag-knowledge-systems/retrieval-pipeline/reranking-strategies\">重排策略</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"工具选择-被忽视的选择维度\">工具选择：被忽视的选择维度</h2><p>选择常被狭义理解为选文本，但工具定义同样要选。给智能体挂上百个工具，会带来两个问题：工具 schema 本身吃掉大量固定预算（见预算篇的 MCP 例子），且模型在过多选项间更易选错、分心。2026 年的主流做法是工具路由——按当前任务阶段只暴露可能用到的工具子集，或把同类工具收敛成少数高层工具。Cloudflare 把 2500+ 端点收敛成两个工具，正是工具选择的极端案例。</p>\n<p>工具选择的设计与提示工程的工具使用衔接，见 <a href=\"../../prompt-engineering/advanced-patterns/tool-use-prompting\">工具使用提示</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"选择是动态的-不是一次性的\">选择是动态的，不是一次性的</h2><p>最后一个关键点：选择在智能体的每一轮都要重做。第 3 轮相关的检索片段，第 15 轮可能已经无关；第 1 轮挂的工具，到了收尾阶段该被换掉。把选择写成「会话开始时拼一次」是常见错误——它会让窗口越跑越偏离当前子任务。动态选择与「把信息存到窗口外、需要时再选回来」是一体两面，后半部分见 <a href=\"../management/memory-offloading\">记忆卸载与外存</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>选择是带预算约束的相关性排序，目标是「选准」而非「选多」；多选一段无关内容的代价是稀释关键内容的注意力。</li>\n<li>相关性是语义相似度、时近性、重要度的加权合成，单信号 top-k 是常见退化。</li>\n<li>召回宽、入窗窄：3–5 段精选通常优于十几段平庸片段。</li>\n<li>工具定义也是选择对象，工具路由能省下巨大的固定预算并减少分心。</li>\n<li>选择须每轮动态重做，与窗外记忆的选回是一体两面。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>选中后怎么排：<a href=\"context-ordering\">排序与位置效应</a></li>\n<li>放不下怎么缩：<a href=\"context-compression\">上下文压缩</a></li>\n<li>窗外候选从哪来：<a href=\"../management/memory-offloading\">记忆卸载与外存</a></li>\n<li>跨库：检索排序 — <a href=\"../../rag-knowledge-systems/retrieval-pipeline/retrieval-ranking\">检索排序</a></li>\n<li>跨库：记忆检索相关性 — <a href=\"../../ai-agent-memory-systems/operations/retrieval-relevance\">记忆检索相关性</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"上下文选择","id":"上下文选择"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"相关性判据：不只是语义相似","id":"相关性判据-不只是语义相似"},{"level":2,"text":"top-k 不是越大越好","id":"top-k-不是越大越好"},{"level":2,"text":"工具选择：被忽视的选择维度","id":"工具选择-被忽视的选择维度"},{"level":2,"text":"选择是动态的，不是一次性的","id":"选择是动态的-不是一次性的"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"上下文工程与提示工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-context-engineering/foundations/context-vs-prompt"},"next":{"title":"排序与位置效应","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-context-engineering/assembly/context-ordering"}}